{"id":"msg_m_ex_arcana_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_arcana","label":"Arcana · Nikke"},"label":"3. I have to tell you that I'm a little upset.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_arcana_02","next":"msg_m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01","speakers":{"arcana":"Arcana"},"icons":{"arcana":"si_c581_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_1","text":"I have to tell you that I'm a little upset.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_2","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_2","text":"What? Why?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_3","text":"It's not like","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_4","text":"I was expecting you to respond with tears of joy,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_5","text":"but you could have at least","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_6","text":"thanked me for the gift.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_7","text":"I don't understand.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_8","text":"It took me forever to work up the courage to say this.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_9","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_9","text":"Hold on.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_10","text":"I feel so pathetic and clingy now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_11","text":"And honestly, I know I'm being clingy,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_12","text":"but so what?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_13","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_13","text":"I check around for any deliveries, but there's nothing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_14","text":"What gift? I didn't get anything.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_15","text":"What?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_16","text":"What did you send?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_17","text":"Wait.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_18","text":"Just a moment.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_19","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_19","text":"Arcana doesn't reply for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_20","text":"!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_21","text":"!!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_22","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_23","text":"I sent it to the wrong address!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_24","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_25","text":"I accidently","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_26","text":"had it shipped to the library.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_27","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_28","text":"It showed up as delivered two days ago,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_29","text":"so I thought you had already received it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_30","text":"Turns out it's in our mail room.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_31","text":"Oh well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_32","text":"I'll just ask Boss to erase all my memories concerning this, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_33","text":"Haha, it's okay. These things happen.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_34","text":"Sure,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_35","text":"it's not a big deal to mess up the address,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_36","text":"but to sit around","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_37","text":"moping and whining about it...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_38","text":"So, what's the gift anyway?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_39","text":"Some cologne","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_40","text":"that I thought would suit you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_41","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_41","text":"I'll stop by and pick it up.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_42","text":"No!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_43","text":"You can't come now!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_44","text":"Hahaha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_45","text":"Are you antagonizing me on purpose?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_46","text":"Give me some time to calm myself down.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_47","text":"I just need a moment.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_48","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_48","text":"Okay, okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_49","text":"I'll resend","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_50","text":"the cologne to you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_51","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_51","text":"Thanks. I'm sure I'll get a lot out of it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_52","text":"Great.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_53","text":"I'll be checking to make sure you do!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_54","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_54","text":"Haha, all right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_55","text":"Also.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_56","text":"I'm sorry for all that stuff I said earlier.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_57","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_57","text":"It's okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcana_03_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcana_03_58","text":"Hehe :P","jump":null}],"chat":true}